  "summary": "The concise study explains how a disciple can learn to desire the coming Judge and how the Church can await the Son already received in Communion, and comparison with the expansive study, the 1962 Missal, Romans and the cited expositions identified two synthesis repairs in attribution and prose. The ten-page working proof has eleven appointments and four senses on page 1, the date sheet alone on page 2 (Luke 21:25\u201333 locates Jesus\u2019 teaching in Jerusalem, with its event date unresolved and composition alternatives separately stated), substantive themes on pages 3\u20134 and developed commentary from page 5."
